WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.050
Welcome to <c.hl>Seodaemun-gu</c>!

2
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.350
Sorting your trash correctly <c.hl>isn't hard</c>.

3
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.800
Trash falls into <c.hl>general waste</c>,
<c.hl>food waste</c>, <c.hl>recyclables</c>,

4
00:00:19.850 --> 00:00:23.300
and <c.hl>bulky &amp; special</c>
<c.hl>waste</c>: <c.hl>four types</c> in all.

5
00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:28.350
Here's <c.hl>A, a student</c> who just moved in!

6
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.180
The <c.hl>bag types</c> are confusing,

7
00:00:30.220 --> 00:00:33.700
and A doesn't know if <c.hl>bags from</c>
<c.hl>the old district</c> still work.

8
00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:38.600
<c.note>[On screen] General waste: pay-as-you-throw bag</c>
<c.note>Food waste: food waste bag</c>

9
00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:43.200
<c.note>[On screen] Another district's bag ✕</c>
<c.note>Official bags: sold at convenience stores, marts</c>

10
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.220
What if you casually put
trash out <c.hl>in the daytime</c>

11
00:00:47.260 --> 00:00:49.600
<c.hl>under a street tree</c> or
<c.hl>by a neighbor's door</c>?

12
00:00:50.400 --> 00:00:53.700
Breaking the disposal
rules can get you <c.hl>fined</c>!

13
00:00:53.750 --> 00:00:56.500
Be sure to check <c.hl>the rules</c>
for your neighborhood.

14
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:04.250
<c.note>[On screen] Fines: not using official bags ₩200,000</c>
<c.note>Wrong time, day or place ₩100,000 · Mixing waste ₩100,000</c>

15
00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:07.350
If your trash wasn't collected,
<c.note>[On screen] ☑ Wrong bag</c>

16
00:01:07.400 --> 00:01:09.850
check the reason on the
<c.hl>“not collected” sticker</c>,

17
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.600
<c.hl>fix it</c>,

18
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:17.750
and put it out again on
<c.hl>the next collection day</c>.

19
00:01:22.300 --> 00:01:23.600
Don't worry!

20
00:01:23.700 --> 00:01:27.120
Just scan the <c.hl>QR code</c> on your
dorm entrance or collection point

21
00:01:27.160 --> 00:01:28.600
to open the guide.

22
00:01:30.100 --> 00:01:33.000
You can check the exact <c.hl>collection days</c>

23
00:01:33.040 --> 00:01:34.600
for your own neighborhood right away.

24
00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:39.200
<c.note>[On screen] e.g. Yeonhui-dong → Tue, Thu &amp; Sun evenings</c>

25
00:01:39.800 --> 00:01:43.400
Use the <c.hl>QR code</c> to easily look
up how to throw things out.

26
00:01:50.600 --> 00:01:52.700
First: <c.hl>where to put it out</c>!

27
00:01:52.740 --> 00:01:55.450
Houses and shops: <c.hl>in front</c>
<c.hl>of your own home or shop</c>.

28
00:01:55.690 --> 00:01:59.300
Apartments and dorms: at <c.hl>the</c>
<c.hl>designated spot in your complex</c>.

29
00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:06.600
<c.note>[On screen] Apartments, dorms:</c>
<c.note>check with the building manager</c>

30
00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:09.000
Second: <c.hl>when to put it out</c>!

31
00:02:09.230 --> 00:02:13.450
Put it out on your collection
days <c.hl>between 6 and 11 p.m.</c>

32
00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.700
Third: <c.hl>the four rules of recycling</c>!

33
00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:19.880
Remember: <c.hl>empty</c>,

34
00:02:19.950 --> 00:02:22.680
Remember: empty, <c.hl>rinse</c>,

35
00:02:22.750 --> 00:02:25.480
Remember: empty, rinse, <c.hl>separate</c>,

36
00:02:25.550 --> 00:02:27.900
Remember: empty, rinse,
separate, and <c.hl>don't mix</c>.

37
00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:33.050
Time for a quick <c.hl>quiz</c>!

38
00:02:33.300 --> 00:02:41.500
In Seodaemun-gu, can you use <c.hl>another district's</c>
<c.hl>bags</c> or put trash out <c.hl>in the daytime</c>?

39
00:02:41.600 --> 00:02:44.100
The answer to both is <c.hl>X: no</c>!

40
00:02:44.200 --> 00:02:48.700
<c.note>[On screen] ✕ Use Seodaemun-gu's own bags</c>
<c.note>✕ Put it out from 6 PM to 11 PM</c>

41
00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:51.300
Let's keep <c.hl>Seodaemun-gu clean</c>!

42
00:02:51.640 --> 00:02:53.560
If you have trash to throw out today,

43
00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:56.200
check it with the <c.hl>QR code</c> right now!

44
00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:59.900
<c.note>[On screen] Contact: Seodaemun-gu Office,</c>
<c.note>Sanitation Admin. Division</c>
